deon\u2122 HD 6XXX or higher"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","10000 MB available space"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"You lead a pair of Source Hunters who begin by looking into a murder in the coastal town of Cyseal, an inquiry that grows into something far larger. Fights are turn-based and the terrain matters: oil burns, water conducts electricity, and poison clouds can be ignited. Between battles you roam an open map, talk to nearly everyone, and tackle quests and puzzles in whatever order you like.\n\nThis Enhanced Edition adds voice acting, full controller support and local co-op, so two people can share one party on one screen. It is a slow, tactical, text-rich role-playing game for players who enjoy building characters and experimenting with systems, and it works well solo or with a friend."}}